# What is AI?

Let's start by activating your current understanding of AI.

Below are examples of various technologies. Use the toggle switches and classify each one as something that does use or do not use AI. 

👉 Click on the box to get the answer and explanation. It’s okay if you don’t get them all!

---

<!--Self-Driving Cars-->

<div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:24px; max-width:1100px; margin:20px auto;">
<iframe src="https://micahkennedy.github.io/embeddings/" width="190" height="70" style="border:none; overflow:hidden; flex-shrink:0; display:block; margin-top:8px;"></iframe>
<div style="flex:1;">
<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; background:white;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA; font-size:18px; font-weight:600;">
Self-Driving Cars
</summary>
<div style="padding:18px 24px; background:white; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB;">
<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:14px;">
<div style="display:inline-block; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:white; background:#2E7D32; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; white-space:nowrap; margin-top:2px;">
Uses AI
</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
Self-driving cars use AI and machine learning to analyze sensor data, understand surroundings, and make safe driving decisions in real time.
</div>
</div>
</div>
</details>
</div>
</div>

<!--3D Printing-->

<div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:24px; max-width:1100px; margin:20px auto;">
<iframe src="https://micahkennedy.github.io/embeddings/" width="190" height="70" style="border:none; overflow:hidden; flex-shrink:0; display:block; margin-top:8px;"></iframe>
<div style="flex:1;">
<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; background:white;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA; font-size:18px; font-weight:600;">
3D Printing
</summary>
<div style="padding:18px 24px; background:white; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB;">
<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:14px;">
<div style="display:inline-block; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:white; background:#C62828; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; white-space:nowrap; margin-top:2px;">
Does Not Use AI
</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
3D printing builds objects layer by layer from a digital file and does not use AI because it follows preset models and instructions.
</div>
</div>
</div>
</details>
</div>
</div>

<!--Music Recommendation Systems-->
<div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:24px; max-width:1100px; margin:20px auto;">
<iframe src="https://micahkennedy.github.io/embeddings/" width="190" height="70" style="border:none; overflow:hidden; flex-shrink:0; display:block; margin-top:8px;"></iframe>
